{"title":"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/7/57735af0dcc6ae64638d79cf17bc32e384c4c1e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2+\\sqrt7} + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt7+\\sqrt{10}}+ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}+\\sqrt{13}} + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{13}+4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"370\" height=\"41\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/1/52154997e9547776f8f7ef93657c2b57a2be0a2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\frac{3}{4}\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ \\frac{3}{2}\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\frac{2}{5}\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"361\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiply all of the terms by their <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Complex_conjugate\" title=\"Complex conjugate\">complex conjugates</a> to simplify:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/1/3f14893a36b7ba62ad3c46d319fe63096df120e5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{7} + \\sqrt{4}} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{7}-\\sqrt{4}}{\\sqrt{7}-\\sqrt{4}}\\right) + \\ldots + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{16} + \\sqrt{13}} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{16}-\\sqrt{13}}{\\sqrt{16}-\\sqrt{13}}\\right)\\]\" width=\"474\" height=\"53\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/b/edb9cdd6875fa177407766654cbe55db51ddc314.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\frac{\\sqrt{7} - \\sqrt{4}}{3} + \\frac{\\sqrt{10} - \\sqrt{7}}{3} + \\frac{\\sqrt{13} - \\sqrt{10}}{3} + \\frac{\\sqrt{16} - \\sqrt{13}}{3}\\]\" width=\"427\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>This <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Telescope\" title=\"Telescope\">telescopes</a> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/9/9e9c2a8f1e632977edd765b2ffb7423aad0083d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{16} - \\sqrt{4}}{3} = \\frac{2}{3} \\Longrightarrow \\mathrm{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"185\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2006 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_14\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_16\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"te